{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/TelemetryEvent\/configClamped(setting:requested:effective:contractReference:)"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Emitted at client construction, once per caller-supplied setting the SDK clamped"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(§19.1, §19.2 rule 6)."}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/telemetryevent\/configclamped(setting:requested:effective:contractreference:)"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/TelemetryEvent"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"configClamped","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"setting","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"requested","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"effective","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"contractReference","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"the configuration property’s name, e.g. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"decisionMemoTtl"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"name":"setting"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"the value the caller asked for, rendered.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"requested"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"the value actually in force, rendered."}]}],"name":"effective"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"the §-reference for the limit, e.g. ","type":"text"},{"code":"§17.1 rule 2","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"name":"contractReference"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Clamping rather than rejecting is the right call — rejecting would fail construction for a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"caller whose configuration was merely optimistic, and honoring would let one client become"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the herd §16 exists to prevent. Doing it "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"silently"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is the part that is wrong: an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"operator who set a 60-second memo TTL believes their staleness bound is 60 seconds. It is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"five, and their revocation reasoning is off by a factor of twelve with nothing anywhere to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"say so."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Not emitted for a value already within its limit: an event that fires when nothing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"happened trains its reader to ignore it.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"title":"TelemetryEvent.configClamped(setting:requested:effective:contractReference:)","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK14TelemetryEventO13configClampedyACSS_S3StcACmF","symbolKind":"case","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"configClamped","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"setting","kind":"externalPara